      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "90fc558ecb6907316f0c5e44d3e504b5483e892cf23716a8f8e750481494f222",
      "text": "The Parade of Champions at the Sambadrome, the Iguazu Falls from both sides and three nights by the sea in Búzios. Over ten days, visit Sugar Loaf and Corcovado, enjoy scenic walks beside the cascades and relax on the beaches of the peninsula. The tour runs from 12 to 21 February 2027, with the Champions Parade ticket, English-speaking guided excursions and transfers as described included.",
